 2026 11:59:11 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/eth-price-up-10-in-april-so-why-is-ethereum-foundation-selling</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/eth-price-up-10-in-april-so-why-is-ethereum-foundation-selling?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0NmItNTZiZS03NzI5LThhYjAtOTk3YzU4NDhlMzVjLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"ETH price up 10% in April, so why is Ethereum Foundation selling?\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>ETH's price may drop 15% or more in the coming days as it paints a convincing bearish reversal pattern on its daily chart.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yashu Gola</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0NmItNTZiZS03NzI5LThhYjAtOTk3YzU4NDhlMzVjLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0NmItNTZiZS03NzI5LThhYjAtOTk3YzU4NDhlMzVjLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Market Analysis</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kbank teams with Ripple on overseas blockchain remittance trial</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:32:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:32:46 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kbank-tests-ripple-wallet-for-remittances-as-south-korea-weighs-stablecoin-rules</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kbank-tests-ripple-wallet-for-remittances-as-south-korea-weighs-stablecoin-rules?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMTktZGVhNC03ODRlLTk1YzItMzEyNjViMmJiMDQzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kbank teams with Ripple on overseas blockchain remittance trial\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Kbank partnered with Ripple to test blockchain-based overseas remittances as South Korean companies prepare for new stablecoin and digital asset rules.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Ezra Reguerra</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMTktZGVhNC03ODRlLTk1YzItMzEyNjViMmJiMDQzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMTktZGVhNC03ODRlLTk1YzItMzEyNjViMmJiMDQzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>MiCA-licensed Banking Circle joins bank stablecoin settlement race in Europe</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:15:52 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:15:52 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/mica-licensed-banking-circle-joins-bank-stablecoin-settlement-race-in-europe</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/mica-licensed-banking-circle-joins-bank-stablecoin-settlement-race-in-europe?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNmItOWUyNC03YjgzLTkzYjItNWE4YzVjMjczNjBjLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"MiCA-licensed Banking Circle joins bank stablecoin settlement race in Europe\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Banking Circle's stablecoin settlement launch follows its CASP approval, entering a crowded market with SocGen, Sygnum and a 12-bank euro stablecoin consortium.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNmItOWUyNC03YjgzLTkzYjItNWE4YzVjMjczNjBjLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNmItOWUyNC03YjgzLTkzYjItNWE4YzVjMjczNjBjLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin leads $1.2B weekly inflows into crypto investment products</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 10:58:36 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 10:58:36 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-1-2-billion-inflows-four-week-streak</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-1-2-billion-inflows-four-week-streak?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNWUtMGYwNC03Yjg3LTg0ODktOTE1ZmQ5YjY5MDkxLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin leads $1.2B weekly inflows into crypto investment products\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Crypto ETPs see $1.2 billion inflows in fourth straight week as Bitcoin leads gains and blockchain equity ETFs hit record demand, CoinShares reported.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Helen Partz</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNWUtMGYwNC03Yjg3LTg0ODktOTE1ZmQ5YjY5MDkxLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlNWUtMGYwNC03Yjg3LTg0ODktOTE1ZmQ5YjY5MDkxLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>88 people charged over 12 crypto wrench attacks in France</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 07:45:40 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 07:45:40 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/88-people-charged-over-12-crypto-wrench-attacks-in-france</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/88-people-charged-over-12-crypto-wrench-attacks-in-france?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YmViNGYtOTMwYS03OGUwLWI5ZjUtY2YwNjg4Mzc3NWQ4LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"88 people charged over 12 crypto wrench attacks in France\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>French law enforcement agencies have been investigating wrench attacks and found that some of the alleged offenders were involved in multiple incidents</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YmViNGYtOTMwYS03OGUwLWI5ZjUtY2YwNjg4Mzc3NWQ4LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YmViNGYtOTMwYS03OGUwLWI5ZjUtY2YwNjg4Mzc3NWQ4LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Prediction markets reflect 'wisdom of an informed minority,’ not crowd: Study</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 07:16:11 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 07:16:11 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/prediction-markets-reflect-wisdom-of-an-informed-minority-not-crowd-study</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/prediction-markets-reflect-wisdom-of-an-informed-minority-not-crowd-study?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMDItNzMyMC03ZDQyLThhOTMtYjcyYTMyMDM1YzZlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Prediction markets reflect 'wisdom of an informed minority,’ not crowd: Study\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>About 3.5% of informed traders, including market makers and skilled takers, capture over 30% of profits on prediction platforms, while about 67% of users absorb the entirety of losses.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMDItNzMyMC03ZDQyLThhOTMtYjcyYTMyMDM1YzZlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNlMDItNzMyMC03ZDQyLThhOTMtYjcyYTMyMDM1YzZlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Western Union eyes May for its stablecoin USDPT rollout</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 05:24:58 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 05:24:58 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/western-union-usdpt-stablecoin-may-launch-dan-network</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/western-union-usdpt-stablecoin-may-launch-dan-network?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5YWYzOGQtNTY3YS03ZjQxLTg0NmEtZDdiZGRjMDU0Y2U1.jpg\" alt=\"Western Union eyes May for its stablecoin USDPT rollout\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Western Union CEO Devin McGranahan said the company will focus on expanding adoption and embedding digital assets into its core money movement platform going forward.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5YWYzOGQtNTY3YS03ZjQxLTg0NmEtZDdiZGRjMDU0Y2U1.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5YWYzOGQtNTY3YS03ZjQxLTg0NmEtZDdiZGRjMDU0Y2U1.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Aave asks Arbitrum to send 30K ETH from Kelp exploiter to ‘DeFi United’</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 04:20:58 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 04:20:58 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/arbitrum-dao-asked-to-unfreeze-30k-eth-tied-to-kelp-hacker-direct-them-to-defi-united</guid>\n      <link><!