.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNiYTUtOTBiOC03NzAxLWFhYTktOTE5MTUzM2YzZDlhLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"'Historical average' could push Bitcoin bottom at $57K level: Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin was “rejected” from the $80,000 price level, which is its next resistance zone on the way to reclaiming the $100,000 psychological price level.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNiYTUtOTBiOC03NzAxLWFhYTktOTE5MTUzM2YzZDlhLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNiYTUtOTBiOC03NzAxLWFhYTktOTE5MTUzM2YzZDlhLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Strategy's Michael Saylor again hints at impending BTC purchase</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 20:09:09 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 20:09:09 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/strategy-michael-saylor-bitcoin-purchase</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/strategy-michael-saylor-bitcoin-purchase?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDMvMDE5Y2NmM2QtNzBmOS03MGZlLTgwN2UtNDE3MDlkYzg1MjY0LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Strategy's Michael Saylor again hints at impending BTC purchase\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The biggest Bitcoin treasury company's data shows holdings are profitable, having gained about 3.3% amid Bitcoin's rally to about $78,000.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDMvMDE5Y2NmM2QtNzBmOS03MGZlLTgwN2UtNDE3MDlkYzg1MjY0LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDMvMDE5Y2NmM2QtNzBmOS03MGZlLTgwN2UtNDE3MDlkYzg1MjY0LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Litecoin gives post-attack update, but other devs doubt zero-day theory</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 18:15:30 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 18:15:30 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-post-mortem-chain-reorganization</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-post-mortem-chain-reorganization?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNhN2UtZmIzNC03OTE0LWFlMDktMjg3ODFkMGYwNjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Litecoin gives post-attack update, but other devs doubt zero-day theory\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Valid transactions that occurred during the affected blocks were not impacted and remain on the main chain, the Litecoin development team said.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNhN2UtZmIzNC03OTE0LWFlMDktMjg3ODFkMGYwNjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGNhN2UtZmIzNC03OTE0LWFlMDktMjg3ODFkMGYwNjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Market conditions force 1 in 3 crypto traders to cut everyday spending: Survey</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 13:48:35 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 13:48:35 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-conditions-force-1-in-3-crypto-traders-to-cut-everyday-spending-survey</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-conditions-force-1-in-3-crypto-traders-to-cut-everyday-spending-survey?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5YjMtYWQ5NS03NTBiLThiYjQtMDE5MzRjMWU1YmJhLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Market conditions force 1 in 3 crypto traders to cut everyday spending: Survey\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>More than a third of US crypto traders report cutting daily expenses and delaying major purchases as unrealized losses weigh on household finances.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5YjMtYWQ5NS03NTBiLThiYjQtMDE5MzRjMWU1YmJhLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5YjMtYWQ5NS03NTBiLThiYjQtMDE5MzRjMWU1YmJhLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Ethereum Foundation unstakes 17K ETH after nearing 70K staked ETH milestone</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 11:55:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 11:55:32 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-foundation-unstakes-17k-eth-after-nearing-70k-staked-eth-milestone</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-foundation-unstakes-17k-eth-after-nearing-70k-staked-eth-milestone?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5NDQtZGIzMS03NWE2LTlmNGUtN2ZiZTNiMTRkNDEwLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Ethereum Foundation unstakes 17K ETH after nearing 70K staked ETH milestone\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Ethereum Foundation unstaked over 17,000 ETH worth $40M shortly after approaching its 70,000 ETH staking target.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5NDQtZGIzMS03NWE2LTlmNGUtN2ZiZTNiMTRkNDEwLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM5NDQtZGIzMS03NWE2LTlmNGUtN2ZiZTNiMTRkNDEwLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Trump’s official memecoin extends slide as he hosts exclusive investor gala</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 08:58:23 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 08:58:23 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-s-official-memecoin-extends-slide-even-as-he-hosts-exclusive-investor-gala</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/trump-s-official-memecoin-extends-slide-even-as-he-hosts-exclusive-investor-gala?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM4OWUtYjBhMS03YTgzLWJiODUtNjYwOTI4MzYxMmY2LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Trump’s official memecoin extends slide as he hosts exclusive investor gala\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>TRUMP memecoin fell nearly 10% in 24 hours despite a Mar-a-Lago investor gala, with the token still down over 96% from its peak.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM4OWUtYjBhMS03YTgzLWJiODUtNjYwOTI4MzYxMmY2LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM4OWUtYjBhMS03YTgzLWJiODUtNjYwOTI4MzYxMmY2LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US DOJ sentences man to 70 months in prison for role in $263M scam group</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 22:05:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 22:05:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/doj-sentence-70-months-263m-crypto-scam</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/doj-sentence-70-months-263m-crypto-scam?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM2NzAtN2QzZC03NjRmLWE4MzAtN2MyZjIwNjIxNjEzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"US DOJ sentences man to 70 months in prison for role in $263M scam group\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The group spent tens of millions of dollars on luxury items and real estate, using funds stolen from crypto users in social engineering scams.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM2NzAtN2QzZC03NjRmLWE4MzAtN2MyZjIwNjIxNjEzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM2NzAtN2QzZC03NjRmLWE4MzAtN2MyZjIwNjIxNjEzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoiners cast doubt on the US military's understanding of the network</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 19:36:29 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 19:36:29 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoiners-cast-doubt-us-military-bitcoin</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoiners-cast-doubt-us-military-bitcoin?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM1ZDYtZTVjMC03MTM1LWI5MzctN2FkNzZlZjljZDhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoiners cast doubt on the US military's understanding of the network\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin advocate Matthew Kratter said US Navy Admiral Samuel Paparo's Senate testimony on Tuesday sounded like it was written by an \"intern.\"</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM1ZDYtZTVjMC03MTM1LWI5MzctN2FkNzZlZjljZDhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM1ZDYtZTVjMC03MTM1LWI5MzctN2FkNzZlZjljZDhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>CFTC sues New York over bid to apply gambling laws to prediction markets</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 14:03:17 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 14:03:17 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-sues-new-york-over-bid-to-apply-gambling-laws-to-prediction-markets</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-sues-new-york-over-bid-to-apply-gambling-laws-to-prediction-markets?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0YjItNDNkNS03MjBjLWI4ZTYtYmY5MWNkZDMyNDAzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"CFTC sues New York over bid to apply gambling laws to prediction markets\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The CFTC has filed suit to block New York from enforcing gambling laws on prediction platforms, arguing federal regulators have sole authority over event-based contracts.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0YjItNDNkNS03MjBjLWI4ZTYtYmY5MWNkZDMyNDAzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGM0YjItNDNkNS03MjBjLWI4ZTYtYmY5MWNkZDMyNDAzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin traders eye $73K next as weekly trend line holds price hostage</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 12:22:17 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 12:22:17 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-traders-eye-73k-next-weekly-trend-line-holds-price-hostage</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-traders-eye-73k-next-weekly-trend-line-holds-price-hostage?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5Yjc0ZmQtNDBlYS03MTFkLTg0OGEtMjMzNzA2ZjdhMThjLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin traders eye $73K next as weekly trend line holds price hostage\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin market participants favored a short-term return to $73,000 as resistance stayed in place, with some analysis seeing even lower levels.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by William Suberg</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5Yjc0ZmQtNDBlYS03MTFkLTg0OGEtMjMzNzA2ZjdhMThjLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMTIvMDE5Yjc0ZmQtNDBlYS03MTFkLTg0OGEtMjMzNzA2ZjdhMThjLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kalshi, Polymarket among 27 prediction platforms banned in Brazil</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 10:51:27 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 10:51:27 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-polymarket-among-27-prediction-platforms-banned-in-brazil</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-polymarket-among-27-prediction-platforms-banned-in-brazil?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzYzItYmY1ZC03OTUxLTgzN2UtYWY4Mjg0NzFiMDgwLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kalshi, Polymarket among 27 prediction platforms banned in Brazil\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Brazil has blocked 27 prediction market platforms, including Kalshi and Polymarket, as new rules classify many contracts as gambling.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzYzItYmY1ZC03OTUxLTgzN2UtYWY4Mjg0NzFiMDgwLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzYzItYmY1ZC03OTUxLTgzN2UtYWY4Mjg0NzFiMDgwLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>XRP may rise 30% as traders withdraw 35M tokens from exchanges in a day</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 08:55:43 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 08:55:43 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/xrp-price-may-rise-30-as-exchange-outflows-hit-nearly-35m-tokens-in-a-day</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/xrp-price-may-rise-30-as-exchange-outflows-hit-nearly-35m-tokens-in-a-day?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzNTgtMmQ1OS03NmUzLWI0YzctNTFlMTRjZWI2MmI0LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"XRP may rise 30% as traders withdraw 35M tokens from exchanges in a day\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Recent XRP outflow spikes have often come before short-term price rallies, signaling a potential move higher in May if the pattern repeats.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yashu Gola</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzNTgtMmQ1OS03NmUzLWI0YzctNTFlMTRjZWI2MmI0LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMzNTgtMmQ1OS03NmUzLWI0YzctNTFlMTRjZWI2MmI0LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Market Analysis</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Spot Bitcoin ETFs see 9-day inflow streak as investors show resilience</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 08:35:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 08:35:46 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-see-9-day-inflow-streak-as-investors-show-resilience</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-see-9-day-inflow-streak-as-investors-show-resilience?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YjkyY2MtZDYwOS03YWY2LWIzYTgtOWIzZjg1NzM2ZWRmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Spot Bitcoin ETFs see 9-day inflow streak as investors show resilience\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>US spot Bitcoin ETFs recorded $2.12 billion in inflows over nine days, signaling growing conviction among investors.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YjkyY2MtZDYwOS03YWY2LWIzYTgtOWIzZjg1NzM2ZWRmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDEvMDE5YjkyY2MtZDYwOS03YWY2LWIzYTgtOWIzZjg1NzM2ZWRmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Hyperliquid whale holds $38M short against Bitcoin, but does it matter?</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 02:35:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 02:35:18 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/hyperliquid-whale-holds-38m-short-against-bitcoin-but-does-it-matter</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/hyperliquid-whale-holds-38m-short-against-bitcoin-but-does-it-matter?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxOWItMTg0ZS03ODM3LWJhZmEtZTczYjA3NGI2OTk5LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Hyperliquid whale holds $38M short against Bitcoin, but does it matter?\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>A Hyperliquid whale holds large short positions against Bitcoin and several altcoins. Does the position provide any signal on the markets’ future outcomes?</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Marcel Pechman</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxOWItMTg0ZS03ODM3LWJhZmEtZTczYjA3NGI2OTk5LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxOWItMTg0ZS03ODM3LWJhZmEtZTczYjA3NGI2OTk5LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Market Analysis</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US authorities freeze $344M in crypto linked to Iran</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 23:16:10 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 23:16:10 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/united-states-freeze-crypto-iran</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/united-states-freeze-crypto-iran?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMzktOTcyYi03NDcxLWIyOTctZjEwMGMxNDJjNTUyLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"US authorities freeze $344M in crypto linked to Iran\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The announced crypto freeze came just one day after Tether said it had frozen $344 million of its USDt stablecoin in response to a request from US law enforcement.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMzktOTcyYi03NDcxLWIyOTctZjEwMGMxNDJjNTUyLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMzktOTcyYi03NDcxLWIyOTctZjEwMGMxNDJjNTUyLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin developer Paul Sztorc announces BTC hard fork called eCash</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:55:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:55:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dev-paul-sztorc-hard-fork-ecash</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dev-paul-sztorc-hard-fork-ecash?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMjItZGM3YS03MTU4LWFmNDEtYjlkYzQzYjM3MTJmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin developer Paul Sztorc announces BTC hard fork called eCash\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The hard fork will introduce a new, competing layer-1 blockchain and seven layer-2 scaling networks, according to Sztorc's announcement.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMjItZGM3YS03MTU4LWFmNDEtYjlkYzQzYjM3MTJmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMxMjItZGM3YS03MTU4LWFmNDEtYjlkYzQzYjM3MTJmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Top memecoin holders expected to attend Trump luncheon</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:17:45 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:17:45 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/tron-justin-sun-donald-trump-memecoin-lunch</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/tron-justin-sun-donald-trump-memecoin-lunch?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwOTctOWVmYi03ZWM0LWI3N2UtNjljMzFlYjJkYjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Top memecoin holders expected to attend Trump luncheon\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The US President has confirmed his attendance for the Florida event, but it's unclear whether Tron founder Justin Sun, suing the Trump family's crypto business, will appear.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwOTctOWVmYi03ZWM0LWI3N2UtNjljMzFlYjJkYjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwOTctOWVmYi03ZWM0LWI3N2UtNjljMzFlYjJkYjhmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Aurelion allocates $48M in tokenized gold to newly launched yield protocol</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 20:40:02 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 20:40:02 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/aurelion-allocates-48m-in-tokenized-gold-to-newly-launched-xaue-yield-protocol</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/aurelion-allocates-48m-in-tokenized-gold-to-newly-launched-xaue-yield-protocol?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwNmQtYjVhZi03ZDMyLWIwNjctMTIyMzIwNzAxMTM0LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Aurelion allocates $48M in tokenized gold to newly launched yield protocol\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The XAUE protocol lets holders earn yield on tokenized gold through lending and trading strategies while maintaining exposure to the underlying asset.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Nate Kostar</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwNmQtYjVhZi03ZDMyLWIwNjctMTIyMzIwNzAxMTM0LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwNmQtYjVhZi03ZDMyLWIwNjctMTIyMzIwNzAxMTM0LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Quantum computer breaks 15-bit elliptic curve cryptographic key</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 18:53:58 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 18:53:58 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/quantum-computer-bit-elliptic-curve-key</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/quantum-computer-bit-elliptic-curve-key?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwODMtM2RjOS03NjE0LWE5YzItMmY1MWVjOWI4MDBmLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Quantum computer breaks 15-bit elliptic curve cryptographic key\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Bitcoin community continues to debate whether cryptographically relevant quantum computers are imminent or decades away.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwODMtM2RjOS03NjE0LWE5YzItMmY1MWVjOWI4MDBmLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwODMtM2RjOS03NjE0LWE5YzItMmY1MWVjOWI4MDBmLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto PAC Fellowship halts support of Texas AG for Senate: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 18:03:20 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 18:03:20 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-pac-fellowship-ads-texas-senate-race</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-pac-fellowship-ads-texas-senate-race?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMWQtMGFiYi03NTBiLWJmZGEtZWJmZjkxM2UxZjBiLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto PAC Fellowship halts support of Texas AG for Senate: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>After reporting more than $1.7 million to election officials, a crypto-aligned political action committee has reportedly backed out of advertising for a Texas Senate candidate.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMWQtMGFiYi03NTBiLWJmZGEtZWJmZjkxM2UxZjBiLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMWQtMGFiYi03NTBiLWJmZGEtZWJmZjkxM2UxZjBiLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto Biz: Same players, bigger bets as crypto eyes a rebound</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 17:06:39 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 17:06:39 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-biz-same-players-bigger-bets-as-crypto-eyes-a-rebound</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-biz-same-players-bigger-bets-as-crypto-eyes-a-rebound?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMzUtZjA3YS03M2NmLWJjM2YtMDg3YWJiOGNjY2RiLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto Biz: Same players, bigger bets as crypto eyes a rebound\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Familiar players ramp up Bitcoin and Ether bets as markets hint at a rebound, while institutions test blockchain rails and US lawmakers stall on crypto rules this week.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Sam Bourgi</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMzUtZjA3YS03M2NmLWJjM2YtMDg3YWJiOGNjY2RiLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjYtMDQvMDE5ZGMwMzUtZjA3YS03M2NmLWJjM2YtMDg3YWJiOGNjY2RiLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>\n<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 13:57:33 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Giant Strategy&#39;s Buying Pace Falls 91% Amid STRC Cooldown</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365620/bitcoin-giant-strategy-buying-pace-falls-strc-cooldown</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 13:57:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Bitcoin-buying firm leaned on common shares to grow its holdings after STRC powered its largest purchase in 16 months.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365620</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/strategy-logo-x-twitter-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/strategy-logo-x-twitter-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Money Launderer Sentenced to 70 Months Over $263M Crypto Social-Engineering Scheme</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365606/money-launderer-sentenced-to-70-months-over-263m-crypto-social-engineering-scheme</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 13:08:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>California money launderer Evan Tangeman admitted to having processed millions in stolen cryptocurrency proceeds.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365606</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin ETFs Extend Longest Win Streak Since September, But Spot Demand Lags</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365604/bitcoin-etfs-extend-longest-win-streak-since-september-but-spot-demand-lags</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 12:34:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The nine-day inflow streak saw spot Bitcoin ETFs draw in $2.1 billion, but experts warn of “net negative” on-chain demand.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365604</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bitcoin-etf-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/bitcoin-etf-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: NFTs Storm Back, Led by Bored Apes</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365600/morning-minute-nfts-storm-back-led-by-bored-apes</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:57:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin made its highest weekly close since January. Western Union is launching a stablecoin. And NFTs are making a major comeback.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365600</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/bored-ape-otherside-decrypt-style2-scaled-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/bored-ape-otherside-decrypt-style2-scaled-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>France Charges 88, Including Minors, in Crypto ‘Wrench Attack’ Crackdown</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365596/france-charges-88-including-minors-in-crypto-wrench-attack-crackdown</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:26:44 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>France has recorded 135 crypto-linked incidents since 2023, amid a nationwide surge in so-called “wrench attacks.&#34;</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vismaya V</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365596</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Western Union to Launch Solana-Based Stablecoin Plus ‘Stable Card’ Next Month</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365593/western-union-to-launch-solana-based-stablecoin-plus-stable-card-next-month</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 10:02:52 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The USDPT stablecoin launching next month will serve as an alternative to SWIFT for agent settlements rather than consumer transactions.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365593</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Western-Union2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Western-Union2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Coachella Uses Google DeepMind AI to Test the Future of Live Entertainment</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365532/coachella-google-deepmind-ai-test-future-live-entertainment</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 19:04:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Coachella is experimenting with AI-built artist tools, immersive digital worlds, and 3D performance archives that could shape future fan experiences.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365532</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/coachella-2026-ai-cropped-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/coachella-2026-ai-cropped-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Your AI Agent Can Now Groan While Untangling Your Vibe Coded Mess</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365511/ai-agent-groan-endless-toil-vibecoding-suffering</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 13:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A new GitHub plugin makes your coding agent emit escalating human moans as it suffers through your spaghetti code.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365511</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/htt