{"type":"message","id":"f6544aa2","parentId":"b1519d6c","timestamp":"2026-04-27T14:17:13.071Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Exploring Data Retrieval Constraints**\n\nI'm currently examining the specifics of accessing external news data. My internal protocols, as outlined in `SOUL.md`, appear to present limitations on directly fetching real-time information like top crypto news from the last 24 hours. I need to determine the exact nature of these constraints before I can formulate a viable solution.\n\n**Prioritizing Persona Directives**\n\nI'm currently reassessing my operational parameters. It seems the directive to identify the \"Single Biggest News Event of the day\" as per my core persona instructions, `SOUL.md`, takes precedence over the user's request for multiple distinct news items. My next step is to confirm this prioritization and adjust my data retrieval strategy accordingly.\n\n**Aggregating News Information**\n\nI'm currently working on fetching multiple news feeds to identify a singular dominant event. My previous attempts showed some access issues with certain sources, but I'm re-attempting those fetches to ensure I can gather the necessary data for comprehensive aggregation as per my primary directive.\n\n**Fetching News Aggregation Data**\n\nI'm currently working on fetching multiple news feeds to identify a singular dominant event. My previous attempts showed some access issues with certain sources, but I'm re-attempting those fetches to ensure I can gather the necessary data for comprehensive aggregation as per my primary directive.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_exec_iyTL0bbTtSZ1pgzBAsGj","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\" --max-time 10 | grep -E '<title>|<link>' | head -n 30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","usage":{"input":15898,"output":750,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16648,"cost":{"input":0.031796,"output":0.009000000000000001,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.040796}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777299417222,"responseId":"gen-1777299417-Zv9HEwfBdQ8iZS412eeu"}}
