{"type":"message","id":"4562d68c","parentId":"3314147a","timestamp":"2026-04-27T14:17:23.342Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The primary topic covered by both CoinTelegraph and Decrypt is the continuous inflow into Bitcoin ETFs.\nCoinTelegraph: \"Bitcoin leads $1.2B weekly inflows into crypto investment products\"\nDecrypt: \"Bitcoin ETFs Extend Longest Win Streak Since September, But Spot Demand Lags\"\n\nI also see another overlapping topic: Wrench attacks in France.\nCoinTelegraph: \"88 people charged over 12 crypto wrench attacks in France\"\nDecrypt: \"France Charges 88, Including Minors, in Crypto ‘Wrench Attack’ Crackdown\"\n\nI will aggregate the data on the \"Bitcoin ETF Inflows\" topic.\nURL 1 (CoinTelegraph): https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-1-2-billion-inflows-four-week-streak\nURL 2 (Decrypt): https://decrypt.co/365604/bitcoin-etfs-extend-longest-win-streak-since-september-but-spot-demand-lags"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_exec_Ej1H8fcuTuQ4BmkyNNVV","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://decrypt.co/365604/bitcoin-etfs-extend-longest-win-streak-since-september-but-spot-demand-lags\" --max-time 15 -L | sed 's/<[^>]*>//g' | tr -s ' \\n' | head -c 2000"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","usage":{"input":17024,"output":304,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17328,"cost":{"input":0.034048,"output":0.003648,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037696}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777299438202,"responseId":"gen-1777299438-jmWjrH1IndfvG6dClE3y"}}
